{"Using r.log.Error for informational messages about the cleanup process is inappropriate and will trigger false positive alerts in monitoring systems - should use r.log.Debug or r.log.Info instead (affects lines 537, 554, 557, 576, 579)": 0.9325894713401794, "The cleanup ticker interval has been reduced from 10 minutes to 1 minute, significantly increasing the frequency of all background cleanup jobs without justification or mention in the PR description": 0.9293816685676575, "Building the comma-separated list of IDs using repeated fmt.Sprintf calls is inefficient (O(N^2) complexity) and can become a performance bottleneck for large batches - should use strings.Builder with strconv.FormatInt instead": 0.4895538091659546, "Checking the configured batch size instead of len(ids) is less accurate for determining when to apply the SQLite parameter limit workaround": 0.721198558807373}